  "description": "Stories included:\n1. **Momo Cinnamon** (모모 시나몬) \\[Yun-Su Lee\\]\n2. **Wangbi** (왕비; Queen) \\[Yeong-Chae Hae\\]\n3. **Nancy wa Lara** (낸시와 라라; Nancy and Lara) \\[Ri-Geon Lee\\]\n4. **Yeouhaegol** (여우해골) \\[Su-Seong Yu\\]\n5. **Be my baby** \\[Gon-Ji\\]\n6. **Eomma** (엄마; Mom) \\[Samgueok\\]\n7. **Oraeorae Haengbokage Saratseumnida?!** (오래오래 행복하게 살았습니다?!; Will We Live Happily Ever After?!) \\[Jep Park\\]\n8. **Najungmalgo Jigeum!** (나중말고 지금!; Not Later, Now!) \\[SONNA\\]\n9. **Bimildongmaeng** (비밀동맹; A Secret Alliance) \\[Du-O\\]\n10. **Immatchumeul Heoyonghagesseoyo** (입맞춤을 허용하겠어요; I’ll Let You Kiss Me) \\[Seo-Yeon\\]\n11. **Ttangeseo Umteun Nalgae** (땅에서 움튼 날개; Wings From the Ground) \\[Hyeon-Jeong Kim\\]\n12. **Eung, Ni Eolgul** (응, 니 얼굴; Yeah, Your Face) \\[Nongyung10\\]\n13. **Boineungeot** (보이는것; What You See) \\[Ga-Yeon Kim\\]\n14. **Eo Dark Sini-ui Sowon** (어둑시니의 소원; The Dark Sini’s Wish) \\[ZQ\\]\n15. **Noineul Wihan Naraneun Eopda** (노인을 위한 나라는 없다; There Is No Country for the Elderly) \\[ALTZ\\]\n16. **Going Home** \\[Sin-Jin\\]\n17. **Goyangipyeonuijeom** (고양이편의점; Cat Convenience Store) \\[So-Yeon Cha\\]\n18. **Gureume Garin Dal** (구름에 가린 달; The Moon Hidden by Clouds) \\[Nagyeopbeoseot\\]\n19. **Myeolmanggwa Silheomui Huisaengyang** (멸망과 실험의 희생양; The Scapegoat for Destruction and Experimentation) \\[Meotjinsegye\\]\n20. **Jjaksarang Jeonmunga K Yang** (짝사랑 전문가 K 양; K, the One-Sided Love Expert) \\[Gonggonggugong\\]\n21. **Yuriro Mandeun Jip** (유리로 만든 집; A Glass House) \\[Jin-Yu\\]\n22. **Taeyangi Nal Wihae Naerijjoeji Aneuna** (태양이 날 위해 내리쬐지 않으나; The Sun Shines for Me) \\[Nallo\\]\n23. **Gyeolhonjeonya** (결혼전야; The Day Before the Wedding) \\[Min-Gyeong Kim\\]\n24. **Chadichanmaeum** (차디찬마음; A Cold Heart) \\[Soyom\\]",
